        {
          "path": "stored.lots",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": 0.0,
          "line": 73,
          "derived": true
        }
      ],
      "parity": "match",
      "notes": "Zero lots with an SL: the parser's R = 25 / (20 x 0 x 10) = +Infinity (JSON string); storage sanitizing turns non-finite metrics into 0."
